@startuml
title CR-001 - Live 2D studio availability snapshot
actor "Authenticated Student / Staff / Admin" as U
participant "Flask Studio Routes" as R
participant "BookingService" as S
participant "Domain current_status" as D
database "SQLite Reservation / Resource" as DB
U -> R : GET /studio
R -> S : status_overview(session.user.id)
S -> DB : SELECT resources and CONFIRMED reservations with end > now
DB --> S : enabled flags + time windows
loop each resource
 S -> D : current_status(enabled, confirmed windows, now)
 D --> S : AVAILABLE / SOON / OCCUPIED / DISABLED
end
S --> R : read-only states, no owner details
R --> U : clickable illustrative 2D map + words and colors
loop every 30 seconds
 U -> R : GET /api/availability-status
 R -> S : status_overview(authenticated actor)
 S -> DB : SELECT confirmed current/future intervals
 DB --> S : intervals, no requester identities
 S --> U : no-store JSON; update status labels
end
note over U,DB
  No physical occupancy sensor or surveyed floor coordinates.
  SOON when next confirmation starts within 15 min.
  Booking still rechecks conflict inside BEGIN IMMEDIATE.
end note
@enduml
